The files in generated/ are written by scripts/compiler/gen-declarative.py
from src/declarative/native/*.pass and src/declarative/cir/cir.ops. The .pass
languages and storage generators live in src/declarative/lang/. Edit those
sources, never the generated Coil. There is no handwritten CIR or assembler
implementation in this package.

Origin and licenses

The CIR and assembler algorithms were ported from coil-tpde's src/tpde/, originally vendored from
https://github.com/jimmyhmiller/coil-tpde at commit 47084950e5908709b4210c7de4066a8a0fe46806.

